A minimal dynamic weather system for the dungeon game.

The system provides:
* A singleton WeatherManager that keeps track of the current weather.
* Visibility multipliers for each weather type.
* Boss AI modifiers that influence boss behaviour.
* Convenience helpers for temporarily changing weather.
"""

